In vanilla nethack, monks have trouble dealing large amounts of damage
without weapons. I think it would be fun to allow gloves to be
poisoned, or perhaps even add a new type of permanently contact-
poisoned gloves, so that a monk could easily deal poison damage.

And the contact-poison gloves should poison you if you pick them up
bare-handed. ;)

"You see here a pair of red gloves."
"G - a pair of red gloves"
"The gloves were coated with contact poison! The poison was deadly..."

(if poison resistant, gives message "the gloves feel somewhat sticky"
or something)

Since gauntlets of power and gauntlets of dexterity are not essential
pieces of an ascension kit, a monk who finds these gloves might
actually be tempted to keep them. And their ability to poison a
careless player adds some balance.



